      "message": "Do you actually need section merging in general, or do you specifically need `.rodata.._start` and `.rodata.._end` to be put before and after `.rodata` because your module does a FIPS140 compliant integrity check?\n\nDo you define `BUILD_FIPS140_KO` when building your module?  That guards other code changes that are needed for the FIPS140 integrity check to work, namely disabling runtime code patching in certain headers.  I think you should be defining it if you aren\u0027t already.\n\nWould it work to just make the linker script change conditional on `defined(BUILD_FIPS140_KO)` instead of `IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_CRYPTO_FIPS140_MOD)`?",
